  "content": "<p>Some impressions from our last Open Doors Day, with a wide range of offerings and lots of demo projects on display.</p><p>It was a great chance to show what the lab is about, share ideas, and give visitors a look at what we build and explore together.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/opendoorsday\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>opendoorsday</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/demostuff\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>demostuff</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/communityevent\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>communityevent</span></a></p>",
